{"id":"ca5826466e6c6854","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Bedrock Model","display":"df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model — ZFC Model8 Bedrock Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model — ZFC Model8 Bedrock Model","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model — ZFC Model8 Bedrock Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (ambient universe, a proper class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,U\">\\(W,U\\)</span> (proper-class ground-model candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{class}\">\\(\\mathrm{class}\\)</span> (sort marker on the metatheoretic class quantifier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^{\\mathrm{class}}\">\\(\\forall^{\\mathrm{class}}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8BedrockModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8BedrockModel}_S\\)</span> (class-level schema defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\)</span> (ground-model predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}bedrock\\text{-}model}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8BedrockModel}_S(W,V)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\n\\land\\forall^{\\mathrm{class}} U\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(U,W)\\to U=W\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}bedrock\\text{-}model}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8BedrockModel}_S(W,V)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\n\\land\\forall^{\\mathrm{class}} U\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(U,W)\\to U=W\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Since the ground predicate permits trivial forcing, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> itself is always a ground of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>; bedrock therefore means that it is the only such ground.</li>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> satisfies the Ground Axiom while also being a ground of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This is explicitly a class-metatheoretic schema. It is not a set predicate on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^2\">\\(V^2\\)</span>, since its arguments are proper-class universes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"W,U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall^{\\mathrm{class}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8BedrockModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}bedrock\\text{-}model}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8BedrockModel}_S(W,V)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\n\\land\\forall^{\\mathrm{class}} U\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(U,W)\\to U=W\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V^2","display":false}],"bytes":1369,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2793","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model.md|58-df-zfc-model8-bedrock-model]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d0244462250ae67e"]}